{"author": "olgasi", "category": "linkedin", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["linkedin-posts-2026-04-20-i-almost-gave-up-on-md-65c086757d:u000002"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "self_report", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "Not through pressure. Not through pushing or beginning But through the kind of conversation that builds trust and helps people move forward.", "unit_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-04-20-i-almost-gave-up-on-md-65c086757d:u000002"}], "text": "Influencing people is not through pressure, pushing, or begging but through conversations that build trust."}, "title": "conversation technique", "topic": "real estate sales technique"}, "content_hash": "5cb541edf284d1d5ad39652ec7a6be3f99322665827db7d74e1bcc4641bad0d0", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "linkedin-posts-2026-04-20-i-almost-gave-up-on-md-65c086757d:knowledge:571cc5878d22857b", "metadata_hash": "53c247293fdb29d6d7202aaca96778d91bd11645392812faba59d72d4118c2c9", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-04-20T04:45:01.883000Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "post", "source_hash": "d6d3a3127bee3cd2638e5091578d5dd02f7758b1655da9baac7131ea6d0d8ce7", "source_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-04-20-i-almost-gave-up-on-md-65c086757d", "source_url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/olgasi_coldcallingtraining-activity-7451853410829582336-iIO7", "title": "conversation technique", "topic": "real estate sales technique", "topic_slug": "real-estate-sales-technique"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "linkedin", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["linkedin-posts-2026-04-20-i-almost-gave-up-on-md-65c086757d:u000003"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "offering", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "I’ll soon be doing a Live Zoom training on Cold Calling and Objection Handling", "unit_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-04-20-i-almost-gave-up-on-md-65c086757d:u000003"}], "text": "I’ll soon be doing a Live Zoom training on Cold Calling and Objection Handling."}, "title": "upcoming live training", "topic": "training announcement"}, "content_hash": "5cb541edf284d1d5ad39652ec7a6be3f99322665827db7d74e1bcc4641bad0d0", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "linkedin-posts-2026-04-20-i-almost-gave-up-on-md-65c086757d:knowledge:e2930c4f97fd31f5", "metadata_hash": "53c247293fdb29d6d7202aaca96778d91bd11645392812faba59d72d4118c2c9", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-04-20T04:45:01.883000Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "post", "source_hash": "d6d3a3127bee3cd2638e5091578d5dd02f7758b1655da9baac7131ea6d0d8ce7", "source_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-04-20-i-almost-gave-up-on-md-65c086757d", "source_url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/olgasi_coldcallingtraining-activity-7451853410829582336-iIO7", "title": "upcoming live training", "topic": "training announcement", "topic_slug": "training-announcement"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "linkedin", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["linkedin-posts-2026-04-20-i-almost-gave-up-on-md-65c086757d:u000001"], "form": "structure", "observation": {"citations": [{"quote": "1. My English was average. 2. Nationality with “no demand” - it was almost no Russian speaking clients back then. 3. No fancy international degree", "unit_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-04-20-i-almost-gave-up-on-md-65c086757d:u000001"}], "text": "The author lists challenges faced at the start of a real estate career in Dubai: average English, no demand for nationality, no international degree, market pricing issues."}, "purpose": null, "speaker_id": null, "title": "initial challenges", "topic": "rhetoric"}, "content_hash": "5cb541edf284d1d5ad39652ec7a6be3f99322665827db7d74e1bcc4641bad0d0", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "linkedin-posts-2026-04-20-i-almost-gave-up-on-md-65c086757d:expression:2d4baecb8a354824", "metadata_hash": "53c247293fdb29d6d7202aaca96778d91bd11645392812faba59d72d4118c2c9", "product": "expression", "published_at": "2026-04-20T04:45:01.883000Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "post", "source_hash": "d6d3a3127bee3cd2638e5091578d5dd02f7758b1655da9baac7131ea6d0d8ce7", "source_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-04-20-i-almost-gave-up-on-md-65c086757d", "source_url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/olgasi_coldcallingtraining-activity-7451853410829582336-iIO7", "title": "initial challenges", "topic": "rhetoric", "topic_slug": "rhetoric"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "linkedin", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["linkedin-posts-2026-04-20-i-almost-gave-up-on-md-65c086757d:u000002"], "form": "structure", "observation": {"citations": [{"quote": "So I had two choices. Quit, buy a ticket, and go back home. Or stay and figure out a different way… I stayed.", "unit_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-04-20-i-almost-gave-up-on-md-65c086757d:u000002"}], "text": "Presents two choices faced: quitting or staying to figure things out, followed by the decision to stay and its positive results."}, "purpose": null, "speaker_id": null, "title": "choice and decision", "topic": "rhetoric"}, "content_hash": "5cb541edf284d1d5ad39652ec7a6be3f99322665827db7d74e1bcc4641bad0d0", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "linkedin-posts-2026-04-20-i-almost-gave-up-on-md-65c086757d:expression:4464dfdb57fa67f5", "metadata_hash": "53c247293fdb29d6d7202aaca96778d91bd11645392812faba59d72d4118c2c9", "product": "expression", "published_at": "2026-04-20T04:45:01.883000Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "post", "source_hash": "d6d3a3127bee3cd2638e5091578d5dd02f7758b1655da9baac7131ea6d0d8ce7", "source_id": "linkedin-posts-2026-04-20-i-almost-gave-up-on-md-65c086757d", "source_url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/olgasi_coldcallingtraining-activity-7451853410829582336-iIO7", "title": "choice and decision", "topic": "rhetoric", "topic_slug": "rhetoric"}
